{
  "name": "03 Purchase confirmation → delivery",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 03 Purchase → delivery\nRazorpay Dashboard → Settings → Webhooks → add `https://YOUR-N8N/webhook/razorpay` with event **payment.captured** and a secret (copy it into Config).\n\n*Self-hosted n8n:* set env `NODE_FUNCTION_ALLOW_BUILTIN=crypto` so the Code node can verify the signature.\n\nTemplate `purchase_delivery` (UTILITY): {{1}} name, {{2}} product, {{3}} link.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "e2b79d38-9957-5d7c-80d5-27a292113876",
      "name": "Setup notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        0
      ]
    },
